From: Anothers <14343424+Anothers@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 92/92] sm121: tune EXL3 v3 x3gm defaults and skip idle RoCE CQ
 polling

Update x3gm's v3_default tuple to .{ .gu = .{ 5, 3 }, .dn = 9 } so
TF_DSV41_GM_V3=1 selects the 16-warp KS=4 LEAN gate/up instances on GB10
(sm_121) instead of the slower 8-warp MTL=2 tiles. Guard Roce.proxyLoop's
periodic idle wire.reap() on !r.linkIdle() so it skips ibv_poll_cq calls
when no WQEs are posted (keeping idle_spins at 20_000_000 and the idle
sleep at 20 us).

Adds host tests for v3_default shape selection in exl3_block_exl3.zig and
atomic idle-poll tracking (Fake.polls + Roce.idle_skips) in
roce_inflight_test.zig.
